sentences.text:
This appeal under Section 173(1) of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988 (hereinafter referred to as 'the Act',
for short) has been filed by the appellants-petitioners being aggrieved by the judgment and award dated 31.08.2020 passed in MVC No.619/2016 by the II Addl. Senior Civil Judge and MACT-VII,
Vijayapura, (hereinafter referred to as 'the Tribunal', for short).
